        <item>
            <title>1.0.40</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>No more freeze when removing a recipient.</strong> Clicking a name in To or Cc and pressing Backspace could make Normal Mail stop responding. Now clicking a name selects it, and Backspace removes just that person.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
