        <item>
            <title>1.0.39</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Improvements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Snappier.</strong> Normal Mail does less work on every request and every email it opens.</li>
<li><strong>Hang reports.</strong> If Normal Mail ever stops responding, it now saves a short report of what it was doing. Help › Show Hang Reports opens the folder — send the newest one along with your feedback so we can fix it.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
